            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ESometimes you need Umbraco to just handle content while your frontend does its own thing. This article compares two approaches: Umbraco\u0026#39;s built-in Content Delivery API versus building your own custom solution. We\u0026#39;ll look at real code, and help you figure out which one actually fits your project.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://24days.in/umbraco-cms/2025/headless-umbraco/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
